            </p>
          </section>
          <section
            class="privacy-section"
          >
            <h3
              class="privacy-section-heading"
            >
              10. Children's Privacy
            </h3>
            <p>
              Moxie is not intended to knowingly collect personal information from children without appropriate consent.
            </p>
            <p>
