              </li>
              <li>
                Resolve disputes
              </li>
              <li>
                Prevent fraud
              </li>
              <li>
                Meet legal and regulatory requirements
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              When information is no longer required, we may securely delete or anonymize it.
            </p>
          </section>
          <section
