              class="privacy-section-heading"
            >
              6. Damaged or Incorrect Products
            </h3>
            <p>
              If your package arrives damaged, opened, tampered with, or contains an incorrect product, please contact Moxie immediately.
            </p>
            <div
              style="background: rgb(251, 247, 239); border: 1px solid rgba(201, 155, 69, 0.4); border-left: 4px solid #c99b45; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 18px; margin: 12px 0px 18px; color: rgb(7, 20, 38);"
            >
              <div
                style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; color: rgb(201, 155, 69);"
              >
                <svg
                  fill="none"
                  height="18"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
